  <History Date="08-10-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Checked" Version="2" />
  <History Date="09-10-12" Author="Pers Creator" Comment="Created - Exported from Diamond 4 file." Version="3" />
  <History Date="09-06-15" Author="Pers Creator" Comment="Imported from Pearl Personality: UKLMH36X.R20" Version="4" />
  <History Date="28-06-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Corrected Tilt function name.  Standardised pan and tilt display ranges and locate for compatibility." Version="5" />
  <History Date="28-06-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Inverted P/T Speed for standardisation.  Increased wheel resolution." Version="6" />
  <History Date="28-06-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Corrected typo on 'Thunder' shutter function." Version="7" />
  <History Date="28-06-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased dimmer, red, green, blue and white wheel resolution.  Changed RGBW to colour attribute group." Version="8" />
  <History Date="28-06-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased zoom wheel resolution.  Changed power on to match locate." Version="9" />
  <History Date="28-06-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised RGBW power on and locate.  Changed pearl ref to match other Viking fixture device names." Version="10" />
  <History Date="28-06-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed '15 DMX' from fixture name as this should be a mode level definition." Version="11" />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" Version="12" />
  <History Date="12-07-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from VK3610 to VK3610 Wash in response to manufacturer request." Version="13" />
  <History Date="12-07-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added 12 channel mode.  Note the shutter, colour macro and p/t invert ranges do not appear to be documented - it is not clear where these originated from." Version="13" />
